        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "MP260 (Man Portable 260) is a compact portable mast. This versatile drilling platform delivers power and precision even at the most difficult-to-access worksites."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "With TEI’s innovative design and lightweight components it is ideal for micropiling, hollow bars and anchoring in complex environments."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "This drilling platform combines agility, durability and high performance, making it a natural choice for contractors who want to optimise both time and results. MP260 is built to handle tough challenges and ensures efficiency and profitability in every project."
