        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "MP260 is a light, powerful and flexible drilling platform that handles everything from confined indoor environments to challenging terrain. Whether you work at airfields, in basements, on rock slopes or on muddy construction sites, MP260 delivers precision and efficiency where traditional machines fail."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "With its compact design and agile construction, MP260 is ideal for micropiling, anchoring and hollow-bar installations. It works excellently in both small spaces and open areas, while being robust enough to handle difficult conditions."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "MP260 is the perfect choice for contractors who require:"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Flexibility: Drilling in confined spaces and hard-to-reach places.",
            "Powerful performance: Stable and efficient drilling even in tough environments.",
            "Precision: Perfect for rock stabilisation, basement reinforcement and foundation work."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Whether it is construction projects, rock work or special anchoring, MP260 is the drilling platform that takes you where the job is. Efficient, light, reliable and ready to deliver results in every situation."
        },
